            "text": "Depth Hand \u2014 Basic Tracking\n\nHand and finger tracking from Ultraleap.\nOutputs channels per hand:\n  hand0:palm:tx/ty/tz \u2014 palm position (meters)\n  hand0:thumb_tip:tx/ty/tz \u2014 fingertip position\n  hand0:grab_strength \u2014 0 (open) to 1 (fist)\n  hand0:pinch_strength \u2014 0 (open) to 1 (pinch)\n\n5 fingers \u00d7 5 bones + palm + wrist per hand.\nRequires Ultraleap SDK.",
